Cochise county has a entirely different community interest than Graham/Graham Counties.  Graham/Greenlee counties are completely tied to the mining community whereas Cochise County has very little.  
The people in Graham/Greenlee counties shop, go to recreation activities, and have their media center in the Phoenix area and tied to the north socially and the with mining. The people in Cochise County shop, go to recreational activities, and have their media center in the Tucson area.  Cochise County is tied economically to the eastern Pima county with their robust tourist interaction.  Also we have nothing in common with the Casa Grand area which is tied to the Phoenix area.

PLEASE LOOK AT PUBLIC COMMENT SUBMITTED ON THE WEBSITE OVER THE LAST WEEKEND (12/4-5) by PEOPLE IN COCHISE COUNTY.  COVID CONCERNS ABOUT MEETING 12/4}

